:<b>Generator</b>   <i>macros/src/</i>
----
• parses <b>language!</b> specs
• emits Rholang <b>Par</b> AST + source-maps
• drives compile-time analyses
   (Ascent, AbstractPar, WPDS, LTL, Lint, Recovery); <<mt>>

-[#1f4e79]-> generates
<i>(compile-time)</i>;

:<b>Runtime abstraction layer</b>   <i>prattail/src/</i>
----
• <b>CekObserver / CekEvent / CekControl</b>
• <b>HeapBudgetStrategy</b>   (replaces concrete GC)
• M:N scheduler / Coordinator / Pool FSM
• <b>ChannelMap</b>   (tagged RSpace / InterSession)
• <b>AbstractPar</b>   (0CFA / k-CFA)
• verify / ltl / recovery / lint / simulation
• <b>RhoEvaluator</b> wrapper; <<mt>>

-[#2e7d32,dashed]-> drives
<i>(runtime: inj, snapshot, restore, lookahead)</i>;

:<b>Rholang VM</b>   <i>f1r3node/rholang/</i>   <i>(external)</i>
----
• <b>DebruijnInterpreter::inj(par, rand)</b>
• RSpace — PathMap-backed tuplespace   (σ)
• Lookahead <b>x!(P)[n]</b> speculation; <<ext>>

